{
  "_comment": [
    "Game registry. Adding a game is a file plus an entry here \u2014 never code.",
    "ROMs live on a mounted volume and are NOT part of any image.",
    "'core' names a libretro core in /usr/lib/libretro; 'exec' runs a binary",
    "directly (used later for Steam)."
  ],
